# Case study demo — local branch only (do not push to remote)

Copy into `.env.local` when working on the paper / case-study demo:

```env
VITE_CASE_STUDY_DEMO=1
```

## Branch layout

| Branch | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `evolve` | Shared product work (fork, tooltip labels, etc.). **No** case-study overlays. |
| `case-study/local` | Paper demo: session content patches. **Keep local; do not push.** |

```bash
git checkout case-study/local   # demo work
git checkout evolve             # normal development
```

## What `VITE_CASE_STUDY_DEMO=1` changes (session `ses_1100d36b…` only)

1. **Todo order** — `Write complete PRD…` (`bffe7fa0…`) sits directly under `Include Webflow editor screenshots…` (`6086640f…`).
2. **Assistant message** — the PRD completion reply is replaced with an English Feishu Wiki link version (OpenCode data unchanged on disk; overlay at fetch time).

Edit overrides in `src/caseStudy/overrides/ses_1100d36baffe9pELzCzwrzi89w.ts`.
